title: a big git diff view is intolerably slow
pid: 4eda8d52-f2ee-4801-92b2-e341c90062cc
body: |2-
  See TODO/general-fast-diffView/ for some work that was done on it,
  and some more that was intended.

  On another copy of my data I ingested TODO.org into jeff/public/,
  and had a few other unstaged changes in other places.
  Marking any change commit-ready in that view
  requires a ton of processing.
  I suspect the client is doing a lot of things
  that the server should instead do.
